---
description: SQL migrations must never use DROP TABLE
globs: "**/*.sql"
alwaysApply: false
---

# No DROP TABLE in SQL

- Never write `DROP TABLE` (including `DROP TABLE IF EXISTS`) in project SQL / migrations.
- Prefer `CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS`, `ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS`, and similar additive changes.
- If schema must be rebuilt, leave it to the operator to do manually; do not automate destructive drops in SQL files.
